WEBVTT

00:06:29.016 --> 00:06:32.917
In 200 B.C., a man named Sekulos

00:06:32.917 --> 00:06:35.867
wrote this song for his departed wife

00:06:35.867 --> 00:06:37.458
and inscribed it on her gravestone

00:06:37.458 --> 00:06:40.083
in the notational system of the Greeks.

00:06:40.083 --> 00:07:07.458
(Music)